{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2023b.q30.material.recovered", "text": "美术老师在上《光色变奏——色彩基础知识与应用》一课时，请物理老师合作。光学理论部分由物理老师讲解，通过三棱镜分光实验分析色谱，进行专业直观展示。美术老师讲解色彩基础理论，并组织学生分组合作绘制色环，完成对比色、邻近色、同类色等作业。然后组织学生分组展示作业，两位老师从不同角度引导学生自评、互评。最后两位老师共同对本课做总结，短短的45分钟过去了，同学们意犹未尽。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6c5293d3b3c648488adb3ab6769e16c9462328f323a0eb35a27da617a878466b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2023, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2205, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6c5293d3b3c648488adb3ab6769e16c9462328f323a0eb35a27da617a878466b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2023b.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s3.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2023b.q30"], "word_count": 182, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6c5293d3b3c648488adb3ab6769e16c9462328f323a0eb35a27da617a878466b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2023, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2205, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考