{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2023b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "赵老师在《山水情怀》的单元教学中，带领学生以“中国传统山水画如何营造情景交融的意境”为基本问题展开3个课时的学习：（1）了解山水画的空间意识；（2）学习山水画的画法；（3）理解山水画的审美意境。赵老师要求同学结合所学知识，尝试运用所学树木、山石画法，创作一幅山水画小品。赵老师依据课标制定了评价标准，对学生的作品评出“优秀，良好、中等和合格”的等级。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6c5293d3b3c648488adb3ab6769e16c9462328f323a0eb35a27da617a878466b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2245, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2420, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6c5293d3b3c648488adb3ab6769e16c9462328f323a0eb35a27da617a878466b"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2023b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k09", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s2.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r010", "ntce.outline.414.r012", "ntce.outline.414.r013", "ntce.outline.414.r020", "ntce.outline.414.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2023b.q31"], "word_count": 175, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2023年下半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6c5293d3b3c648488adb3ab6769e16c9462328f323a0eb35a27da617a878466b", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2245, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2420, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_prec